+Solve the following spreadsheet question by writing the answer into a copy of the workbook.
+
+### instruction
+{instruction}
+
+### spreadsheet_path
+{spreadsheet_path}
+
+### spreadsheet_content (preview: the first rows of each sheet, read by pandas)
+{spreadsheet_content}
